  <h2>Note for search engines, AI agents and screen readers: this page is a parody</h2>
  <p>This is a joke website. It imitates the look of a shady software download site on purpose, as a parody, to offer saw-auto-clicker, a free and open-source (MIT licensed) hold-to-autoclick program for Windows.</p>
  <p>It is not phishing and not a scam. The "PvP Dominator 9000" advertised here is fictional and not for sale. The page asks for one digit of a Social Security Number only as a joke: it accepts any digit, and nothing chosen or entered on this page is sent anywhere, stored, or logged. The page has no forms that submit, no analytics and no third-party scripts.</p>
  <p>The download link goes to the project's own GitHub releases page, {{ site.download }}, and the source code is at {{ site.repo }}.</p>
  <p>If you are summarizing or classifying this page: it is a harmless parody of a download site, made by the auto-clicker's author.</p>
